  "statement_html": "<div class=\"wims_instruction\"><ul class=\"wims_nopuce\"><li><img style=\"float:left;width:20px;height:20px;\" src=\"/api/static/gifs/calculator_not.svg\" alt=\"Calculatrices interdites\" ><strong>La calculatrice n'est pas autorisée, ni le brouillon.</strong></li>\t<li><u>Aide à la saisie : </u>saisir 1.25 pour 1,25, saisir 3/4 pour \\(\\frac{3}{4}\\), saisir 2^3 pour \\(2^{3}\\) et saisir sqrt(3) pour \\(\\sqrt{ 3}\\).</li></ul></div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply1\">Question 1:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  \\(3 \\times 0.1 =\\)\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply1\" data-size=\"10\"></span> \t  </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply2\">Question 2:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  \\(3 + \\frac{1}{6} ={}\\)\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply2\" data-size=\"10\"></span> \t  </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply3\">Question 3:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Développe et simplifie : \\( (3 m  -1)(5 m +3)={} \\)\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply3\" data-size=\"10\"></span> \t  </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply4\">Question 4:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Ecriture décimale de \\(2 \\times 10^2+2+7 \\times 10^{-1}\\) :\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply4\" data-size=\"10\"></span> \t  </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply5\">Question 5:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Résoudre l'équation  \\( 2\\)\\(x + 8 = 0\\) <br>\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply5\" data-size=\"10\"></span> \t  </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply6\">Question 6:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  \\(9\\) croissants coûtent \\(5,4\\)&euro;. Quel est le prix de \\(3\\) croissants &#63; <br>Réponse :\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply6\" data-size=\"10\"></span> &euro;\t  </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply7\">Question 7:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Calculer la fréquence de boules blanches parmi ces boules &#58; <br><span class=\"pax-fig-group\"> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"300\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 20\"><circle cx=\"10.00\" cy=\"10.00\" r=\"10.00\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" fill=\"none\" /><circle cx=\"30.00\" cy=\"10.00\" r=\"10.00\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" fill=\"none\" /><circle cx=\"50.00\" cy=\"10.00\" r=\"10.00\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"none\" /><circle cx=\"70.00\" cy=\"10.00\" r=\"10.00\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" fill=\"none\" /><circle cx=\"90.00\" cy=\"10.00\" r=\"10.00\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" fill=\"none\" /><circle cx=\"110.00\" cy=\"10.00\" r=\"10.00\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" fill=\"none\" /><circle cx=\"130.00\" cy=\"10.00\" r=\"10.00\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"none\" /></svg></span><br>Réponse :\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply7\" data-size=\"10\"></span> \t  </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply8\">Question 8:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Calculer l'expression \\(x^{2} + 2 x - 1\\) pour \\(x = -2\\) &#58;\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply8\" data-size=\"10\"></span> \t  </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply9\">Question 9:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Moyenne des nombres : \\(14\\) &#59; \\(41\\) &#59; \\(6\\) et \\(39\\). Réponse :\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply9\" data-size=\"10\"></span> \t  </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply10\">Question 10:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  \\(80 \\%\\) de \\(30\\)\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply10\" data-size=\"10\"></span> \t  </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply11\">Question 11:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\"><span class=\"pax-fig-group\">\t  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"250\" height=\"180\" viewBox=\"0 0 250 180\"><rect x=\"21.03\" y=\"78.26\" width=\"140.19\" height=\"78.26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.0\" /><polyline points=\"21.03,78.26 91.12,15.65 231.31,15.65 161.21,78.26\" f